    "faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "faq.subtitle": "Everything you need to know about starting your journey with Suhoor.",
    "faq.free": "Is Suhoor completely free to use?",
    "faq.freeAnswer": "Yes! Suhoor is free for all. Our mission is to help everyone eat suhoor, track their fasts and stay connected with friends and families.",
    "faq.groups": "How do the groups work?",
    "faq.groupsAnswer": "You can join or create a group and invite friends or family using a unique code. Once they join, you can wake each other up for suhoor.",
    "faq.mobileApp": "Is there a mobile app?",
    "faq.mobileAppAnswer": "The mobile app is still being developed.",
    "faq.accuracy": "How accurate are the fasting times?",
    "faq.accuracyAnswer": "We use high precision fasting times based on your location. You can also adjust the fasting times in your settings to match your local mosque.",
    "faq.privacy": "Is my location data private?",
